  "body_html": "<h1>lcs_cost_subset</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem lcs_cost_subset (xs : List A) : ∀ (ys : List A), (lcs xs ys).cost.toFinset ⊆ Finset.range (xs.length + 1) ×ˢ Finset.range (ys.length + 1)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>toFinset</li>\n<li>Visited</li>\n<li>IsPositiveAffineOf.trans</li>\n<li>StrictlyPreferred.trans</li>\n<li>Arena.Reachable.trans</li>\n<li>Indifferent.trans</li>\n<li>Subtree.trans</li>\n</ul>",
